1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:04,360
的确是段潮起潮落的人生路
So it has been quite a journey,

2
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:07,560
但自始至终 支持我走下去最大动力是勇气
but through it all, the key for me has been bravery

3
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,560
以及在内心深处我坚信
and the deep-down knowledge

4
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,120
我比所有人都强
that I am better than everyone else.

5
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,600
抱歉 吉利安 你的问题是什么来着
Uh, I'm sorry, Jillian, what was your question?

6
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,780
我问麦克斯是在哪里出生的
I asked Max where she was born.

7
00:00:18,213 --> 00:00:22,100
90号洲际公路的躲猫猫酒吧
The Peekaboo Lounge on I-90.

8
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,320
我妈在舞台的钢管上时
My mom was on the pole

9
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,420
我从她下面跑出来 然后说"找到你啦"
when I popped out and said, "Peekaboo."

10
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,640
你的电影《庞氏公主》
So your movie, The Princess and the Ponzi,

11
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:29,680
有获奥斯卡的希望呢
has Oscar buzz...

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,860
虽然是最佳音效剪辑 但还是很棒啊
for sound editing, but still.

13
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,660
你们打算穿谁家的礼服去首映会呢
Who will you be wearing to the premiere?

14
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:36,100
吉利安 我的上衣来自
Well, Jillian, the top is from

15
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,800
便利商店的失物招领处
the 7-Eleven lost and found,

16
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,640
牛仔裤是我跟人拿刀对砍的战利品
and the jeans I won in a knife fight,

17
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:41,700
所以我也不知道是谁家的
so I didn't get specifics.

18
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:46,140
明星造型师布莱德·格雷斯基找我了
Stylist to the stars Brad Goreski reached out.

19
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,700
他是个时尚警察
He's a fashion policeman,

20
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,500
这是唯一一种还未逮捕过麦克斯的警察呢
the only kind of policeman Max hasn't been arrested by.

21
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:54,160
我们甜品酒吧将会承办首映会的餐饮
Anyway, our dessert bar is catering the premiere.

22
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:56,220
我们真的是越来越能自食其力了
We are really coming into our own.

23
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:57,300
姑娘们
Girls...

24
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:59,080
说到慢慢长大[自食其果]
Oh, speaking of coming into your own,

25
00:00:59,080 --> 00:00:59,700
这位是阿憨
this is Han.

26
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:03,120
你们俩今天有打算来上班吗
Are you coming to work today?

27
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:06,200
还是我该自己来 直接写错客人的点餐就好
Or should I just write down wrong orders for customers myself?

28
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:07,980
阿憨 你看不见我们正在
Han, can't you see we're in the middle

29
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:09,700
接受我大电影的新闻采访吗
of a press interview for my movie?

30
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:11,600
别无视我啊
You can't just ignore me.

31
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:14,020
我又不是你们法院指派律师给的建议
I'm not the advice of your court-appointed lawyer.

32
00:01:15,380 --> 00:01:16,560
听起来你们有很多事情忙
Sounds like you guys are busy.

33
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,080
宣传这部电影 经营这间酒吧
The movie, running this bar,

34
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,600
还要给那个男人打工
and working for that man too.

35
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,100
是男人 对吧
Man, right?

36
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:23,300
我们事业越来越蒸蒸日上
With us blowing up as we are,

37
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:25,140
我跟麦克斯也会慢慢挥别餐厅
Max and I are phasing out the diner

38
00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:27,640
以及摸起来会烫的体香剂
and deodorant that's hot to the touch.

39
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:31,360
它能把臭味都烧掉 我才不要挥别它
It burns the stink away. I'm not giving that up.

40
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:36,180
很高兴聊了...五个小时
Well, that was...five hours.

41
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:38,280
首映会上见
Uh, see you at the premiere.

42
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,775
等等 我们要挥别餐厅吗
Wait, we're phasing out the diner?

43
00:01:41,775 --> 00:01:44,840
看来我以后真的不可以你一开口
I have really gotta stop falling asleep immediately

44
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,780
就秒睡了
whenever you speak.

45
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,180
麦克斯 你自己想想嘛 为啥...
Max, think about it. Why--

46
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,580
阿憨 我们需要跟你谈谈
Han, we need to talk to you.

47
00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:03,480
是的 跟你说话我们也很郁闷
Yeah, we're not happy about it either.

48
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:05,760
毕竟最好的情况
Best-case scenario,

49
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,140
是本可以今天一天都不见到你
we wouldn't have seen you at all today.

50
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:09,740
棒呆了 谈话呢
Oh, good, a talk.

51
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:12,120
我帮你们省点功夫 直接开始哭吧
Let me save you the trouble and just start crying.

52
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:16,400
阿憨 我们要慢慢将餐厅从我们生活中挥别
Han, we are phasing the diner out of our lives.

53
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,620
我现在是有造型师的人了
I have a stylist now.

54
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,980
这是我们的提前两周离职通知
This is our two weeks' notice,

55
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,940
我们这周还需要请假来准备参加首映会
and we need this week off to get ready for the premiere.

56
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,421
我说过我有造型师了对吧
I mentioned I have a stylist, right?

57
00:02:23,421 --> 00:02:27,620
所以就这么抛下我[嗨干]吗
So you leave me high and dry?

58
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:28,300
在你身边我永远都又嗨又"干"
I'm always high and dry around you.

59
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,600
阿憨 我们请了鲍比的姐姐来代班
Han, we got Bobby's sister, Denise, to cover for us,

60
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:33,700
而且她已经迟到了
and she's already late.

61
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,240
跟我们在时一模一样吧
It'll be like we never left.

62
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:39,440
一身大汗还迟到 真是抱歉
Whoo, sorry I'm sweaty and late.

63
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,740
我试了用跑酷的方式赶来这里
I tried to parkour my way here.

64
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:44,540
然后我跟停车收费器亲密接触了
Then I met the business end of a parking meter.

65
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:47,860
简单来说就是撞坏了我的"洞洞"
Basically, I broke my vagina.

66
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:52,500
我能去哪里弄到一大袋冰块呢
Where can I get a big Ziploc bag full of ice?

67
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:55,440
我这有
Uh...here.

68
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:58,140
我本来用它来保存我的肾
I was keeping my kidney in it.

69
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:05,760
鲍比 在明星造型师
Now, Bobby, before stylist to the stars

70
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,400
布莱德·格雷斯基到之前
Brad Goreski gets here,

71
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,120
我们需要下点功夫
we just need to do a little work

72
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:11,020
改善一下你的服装 发型 脸蛋
to fix up your clothes, your hair, your face.

73
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:12,560
你走路姿势也不行
Also, your walk's not great.

74
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:14,640
那我跑步姿势如何
How's my run?

75
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:16,060
因为我现在就挺想跑的
'Cause I feel like doing it right now.

76
00:03:17,140 --> 00:03:18,980
如果你想当造型师 就去帮帮丹妮斯
If you want to play stylist, help Denise.

77
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:20,900
她会把毛衣紮进...
She tucks her sweater in--

78
00:03:20,900 --> 00:03:21,800
袜子里
to her socks.

79
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:26,180
丹妮斯并没有获邀去参加首映会
Oh, Denise isn't invited to the premiere.

80
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:28,820
我不想冒搬石头砸自己脚的风险
I can't run the risk of being embarrassed by someone.

81
00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:30,940
厄尔已经问过我可不可以带
I mean, Earl already asked if he could bring

82
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:33,540
他的睡袋还有购物手推车来了
his sleeping bag and his shopping cart.

83
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,780
够了 厄尔 我们知道你有钱
We get it, Earl, you're rich.

84
00:03:37,581 --> 00:03:43,566
我的礼服出自设计师创·丹
Uh, my dress is by Beddy Spready.

85
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:45,680
就是床单的意思
It's a bedspread.

86
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:50,740
天啊 布莱德·格雷斯基
Oh, my God, Brad Goreski!

87
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:52,660
我无法证明我是
Well, I can't prove it,

88
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,780
因为我刚在外面被人偷了钱包
because someone just stole my wallet outside.

89
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:58,400
好啦 我去搞套西装
All right, I gotta go get a suit

90
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,020
不过得先...
after I get my...

91
00:04:00,020 --> 00:04:01,840
刷睫毛吗 你不是吧
eyelashes highlighted? Seriously?

92
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:03,540
爱你啦
Love you.

93
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,840
我也爱你
Love you too.

94
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:09,200
睫毛的事很正确
Good call on the eyelashes.

95
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:16,600
这公寓里第一次有比我更强的胸[衣架]
First time there's been a better rack than mine in the apartment.

96
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:20,240
这些是你们的候选礼服
Okay, these are the choices.

97
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:22,540
都是从顶级设计师那里借的
They're on loan from the top designers,

98
00:04:22,540 --> 00:04:24,200
如果弄坏了衣服
and if you hurt them,

99
00:04:24,220 --> 00:04:25,680
那些疯婆子会追杀你到天涯海角
those bitches will hunt you down.

100
00:04:26,740 --> 00:04:29,340
如果连《美国警察》汤米·李·琼斯
Well, if Federal Marshal Tommy Lee Jones

101
00:04:29,340 --> 00:04:30,820
都找不到我 她们就算了吧
couldn't find me, good luck.

102
00:04:31,563 --> 00:04:35,200
这件是设计师扎克·珀森的新作
That's a brand-new Zac Posen.

103
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,400
他是帮忙我才借给我的
He gave it to me as a favor,

104
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:38,704
我们共同分享分时房产和对雪儿的爱
because we share a time share and a love of Cher.

105
00:04:38,704 --> 00:04:42,320
分享过度了吗
Over share?

106
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,600
你那边有礼服是
You got anything over there

107
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,182
我不需要刮腋毛就能穿的吗
I won't have to shave my pits for?

108
00:04:45,182 --> 00:04:47,700
你等等
Hmm, hold on.

109
00:04:47,700 --> 00:04:48,620
我找一下
Let me sniff around

110
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:51,040
谢琳·伍德蕾参加演员工会奖穿的那条裙子
for Shailene Woodley's SAG Awards dress.

111
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:55,520
天啊 我好喜欢这条
Oh, my God, I love it.

112
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:57,120
眼光真好
Oh, good eye.

113
00:04:57,200 --> 00:05:00,220
这条裙子价值一万美元
That's a $10,000 dress.

114
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,380
这就是为什么它在这间公寓里
And that's why it looks so lost

115
00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:03,800
看起来是如此迷茫与害怕
and afraid in this apartment.

116
00:05:07,460 --> 00:05:09,920
这价钱够我开一家平价服饰店了
I can own and operate an Old Navy for that.

117
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,700
天啊
Oh, my God.

118
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:15,580
有人打了时尚报警专线吗
Did someone call fashion 911?

119
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,760
时尚警察在这里呢
The fashion police are here!

120
00:05:18,820 --> 00:05:20,480
被认出来好尴尬
Well, this is embarrassing.

121
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:24,080
是啦 我就是明星造型师布莱德·格雷斯基
Yes, I'm celebrity stylist Brad Goreski.

122
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:28,140
抱歉 我还以为你是女主持梅丽莎
Oh, see, I thought you were Melissa Rivers.

123
00:05:29,820 --> 00:05:33,620
你们两个的下巴很像
Yeah, 'cause you guys have very similar jaws.

124
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:39,080
你帮婴儿做造型吗
Hey, do you style babies?

125
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:42,280
我想让芭芭拉在首映会
'Cause I want Barbara to be discovered

126
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:43,480
被人发掘
at the movie premiere.

127
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:46,840
我唯一帮做造型的婴儿是坎耶·韦斯特
The only baby I style is Kanye West.

128
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:53,300
等等 你真的不是梅丽莎·里弗斯吗
Wait, are you sure you're not Melissa Rivers?

129
00:05:58,100 --> 00:06:01,720
麦克斯 这是我再度回归上流社会
Max, this is my reintroduction into high society,

130
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,820
你非得带着肋排上豪车吗
and you had to bring ribs for the limo?

131
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:07,880
某人明显没拍过嘻哈斗牛梗的音乐录影带
Somebody obviously was never in a Pitbull video.

132
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:10,600
这车感觉还得堵好一段时间
Doesn't look like we're going anywhere in this traffic.

133
00:06:10,740 --> 00:06:11,500
给我来根肋排
I'll take a road rib.

134
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,840
麦克斯 你敢把红酒拿靠近我身边
Max, if you get that red wine near me,

135
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:18,000
我就开始唱音乐剧《滑稽女郎》的歌
I will start singing songs from Funny Girl,

136
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,280
而且绝对不停下
and I will not stop.

137
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:21,600
能给我来点"喝了才能忍卡洛琳"果汁吗
Can I some of that "Deal with Caroline" juice?

138
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:28,580
麦克斯 这是你第三声叹气了
Max, that's your third sigh.

139
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,680
是我的妆不够完美吗
Is my makeup not perfect?

140
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:33,620
就连我叹的气都得跟你有关吗
Do even my sighs have to be about you?

141
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:35,680
毕竟今晚我是主角嘛
Well, it is my night.

142
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:38,581
我只是在想这整件电影的事
I was just thinking how this whole movie thing

143
00:06:38,581 --> 00:06:40,980
都起源于去洛杉矶见兰迪
started in L.A. with Randy.

144
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:42,420
有点难过他不在这里
It's kind of sad he's not here,

145
00:06:42,420 --> 00:06:44,340
另外 你的妆有点小丑感
and also, your makeup is a little clowny.

146
00:06:44,660 --> 00:06:45,580
不是吧
Oh, no.

147
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:48,600
好吧 兰迪是唯一一个
Yeah, well, Randy's the only person

148
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,940
我爱过 也接受他的爱的人
I've ever loved or let love me.

149
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:52,940
是有多小丑感
How clowny?

150
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:59,200
你们在这里干嘛
What are you guys doing out there?

151
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:01,640
太堵了 我们就下了出租车
We hopped out of our cab, because of the traffic.

152
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,700
还有就是那车着火了
Also, it was on fire.

153
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:06,380
我们也很想邀请你们上车
Well, we'd invite you guys in here,

154
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:08,280
但这车窗不停地自己关上了
but the windows keep going up on their own.

155
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:22,360
你觉得那个豪车司机
You don't think that limo driver's

156
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:24,020
应该不会把我剩下的卷心菜沙拉都吃完吧
gonna eat the rest of my coleslaw, do you?

157
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:27,160
没人走红毯时说"卷心菜沙拉"
Shh, no one says "coleslaw" on a red carpet.

158
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,600
我觉得你藏在杯座里藏得很妙
I think you hid it pretty well in the cup holders.

159
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:32,280
天啊 看看这里
Oh, my God. Look at all this.

160
00:07:32,980 --> 00:07:34,520
太好了 卡洛琳·钱宁
Oh, good, Caroline Channing.

161
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:37,120
乖乖待着 还没到你
Stay here. It's not your time yet.

162
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,720
我把一台自动倾卸卡车
Oh, that's what the angels said to me

163
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,720
开进河里时 天使们也说了这话
when I drove that dump truck into the East River.

164
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:46,176
快看 《快乐的大脚》的演员
Oh, look, it's the star of Happy Feet.

165
00:07:46,176 --> 00:07:48,380
南极在那个方向
Antarctica's that way.

166
00:07:48,380 --> 00:07:49,540
放屁 是那边
No, it's that way.

167
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,580
好令人兴奋啊
This is exciting.

168
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,740
我上一次见到那么多狗仔队
I haven't seen this much paparazzi

169
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:55,560
