但这造型可以
but it works.

343
00:16:57,740 --> 00:17:00,160
我把意面和肉丸撒自己身上了
I spilled spaghetti and meatballs on myself.

344
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:02,080
你有女朋友吗
You have a girlfriend?

345
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:03,480
没有
No.

346
00:17:04,860 --> 00:17:06,440
别担心 我们会找到"三人行"的第三人
Don't worry, we can find a third.

347
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:12,260
麦克斯发短信给我说
It's from Max. It says,

348
00:17:12,560 --> 00:17:14,460
"速来甜品酒吧 有紧急情况"
"Meet me at the dessert bar. It's an emergency."

349
00:17:14,980 --> 00:17:17,100
她从来不会说某事是紧急情况
She never says something's an emergency.

350
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:19,820
有一次她来上班时 头上插了一把刀都没说
She came to work with a knife in her head.

351
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:28,200
麦克斯 你去哪儿了
Max, where did you go?

352
00:17:28,320 --> 00:17:29,540
你错过了一切
You missed everything.

353
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:30,880
我真的已经尽力了
And as hard as I tried,

354
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,800
可他们就是不愿意再给我一个礼包
they wouldn't give me a second swag bag.

355
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:36,080
礼包里的瑜伽裤我绝不会跟你分享
And I will not share the Kate Hudson yoga pants.

356
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:40,060
那个你留着吧 因为我有这个了
You can have them, 'cause I have this!

357
00:17:45,380 --> 00:17:47,800
你居然偷了一个订婚戒指
You stole an engagement ring?

358
00:17:47,967 --> 00:17:52,140
我能出来了吗 里面太臭了
Can I come out now? It smells in there.

359
00:17:52,140 --> 00:17:53,560
天啊 兰迪
Oh, my God, Randy.

360
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:55,360
麦克斯订婚了你难过吗
Are you upset that Max is engaged?

361
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:56,400
慢着
Oh, wait!

362
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:03,760
我懂为什么你告诉她时要我回避了
Now I know why you wanted to tell her without me.

363
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:04,720
-我回里面臭着吧 -别走
- Back to the smelly room. - No!

364
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:11,800
我的老天
Oh, my God!

365
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:14,320
今晚本来我是主角
This night that was totally about me

366
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:17,220
现在你成了主角 而我一点儿也不嫉妒
is totally about you, and I'm not even jealous!

367
00:18:18,980 --> 00:18:22,560
天啊 你要搬去洛杉矶吗
Oh, my God. Are you moving to L.A.?

368
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:24,120
喜极而泣要变成悲从中来了
Different kind of tears coming.

369
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:27,340
不会 我搬来这里
Nope, I'm moving here.

370
00:18:27,820 --> 00:18:28,760
我早就该这么做了
Should've done it a long time ago.

371
00:18:29,520 --> 00:18:31,020
对了 我不冠夫名
I'm keeping my name, by the way.

372
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:33,380
人们如果叫我兰迪 感觉太奇怪了
It'd be weird for people to call me Randy.

373
00:18:35,020 --> 00:18:36,680
瞧 生活怎么能少了这个呢
See? How can I live without this?

374
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:39,400
瞧 卡洛琳 你的愿望成真了
See, Caroline? You got your wish.

375
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:40,700
我们都有伴侣了
We're both with someone.

376
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:42,400
看来是我的愿望成真了
Looks like I got my wish.

377
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:44,260
我不会跟你孤独终老
We're not gonna die together.

378
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:47,580
非常欢迎你跟我们一起终老
You are more than welcome to die with us.

379
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:49,560
我听说你有个男朋友
So I hear you have a boyfriend.

380
00:18:49,980 --> 00:18:51,100
是啊 他马上就进来
Yeah, he'll be right in.

381
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:53,160
他帮麦克斯从豪车里把卷心菜沙拉拿出来
He's getting Max's coleslaw out of the limo.

382
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:55,740
司机说他没有吃
The driver said he didn't eat it,

383
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:57,660
可他脸上沾满了沙拉酱
but his face is covered in mayonnaise.

384
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:01,339
鲍比 这位是兰迪
Bobby, this is Randy...

385
00:19:01,339 --> 00:19:04,060
-麦克斯的未婚夫[法语] -什么
- Max's fiance. - What?

386
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:06,260
如果你不说美语 我就立马跟他分手
Um, I'll break up with him if you don't talk American.

387
00:19:10,180 --> 00:19:12,540
-你看起来好眼熟 -你也是
- You look familiar. - So do you.

388
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:16,900
你就是那个把
You're that lawyer that

389
00:19:16,900 --> 00:19:19,200
我妈和我姐从真人秀逼走的律师
screwed my mother and sister out of that reality show.

390
00:19:20,940 --> 00:19:23,260
-对 那节目叫... -"搬出去 40岁大宝宝"
- Yeah, it was called... - Move Out, You're 40.

391
00:19:25,280 --> 00:19:27,400
我们不得不解除她们的合约 因为她们是疯子
Yeah, we had to fire them 'cause they're insane.

392
00:19:28,780 --> 00:19:29,840
不好意思 你刚是把
I'm sorry, are you calling

393
00:19:29,840 --> 00:19:31,360
我妈和我姐称为"疯子"吗
my mother and sister insane?

394
00:19:31,360 --> 00:19:35,220
不光是我 整个新泽西州都这么说
Oh, not just me. The state of New Jersey.

395
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:38,180
真有爱 他们认识彼此
Oh, it's so cute. They know each other.

396
00:19:39,099 --> 00:19:41,560
咱们到外面解决 里面有女士
Let's take this outside. There's ladies here.

397
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:43,120
只有一个
Well, one.

398
00:19:43,860 --> 00:19:45,120
好主意
That's a good idea.

399
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:46,900
你这辈子第一个好主意
First one you've ever had.

400
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:48,960
够了
Okay, that's it.

401
00:19:49,600 --> 00:19:51,160
他妈还诅咒我
His mother put a curse on me.

402
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:53,380
在那之后你就没找到过好车位了 对吧
Yeah, and you haven't found a good parking space since, have you?

403
00:19:53,700 --> 00:19:56,280
鲍比 别弄坏你的西服 我们赔不起
Bobby, don't ruin your suit. We can't afford it.

404
00:19:56,980 --> 00:19:58,740
天啊 这真是太糟糕了
Oh, my God, this is terrible.

405
00:19:59,860 --> 00:20:01,040
我能再看一眼戒指吗
Can I see the ring again?

406
00:20:02,660 --> 00:20:05,540
我舔过了 不是糖果做的哦
Um, I licked it, and it's not candy.

407
00:20:13,351 --> 00:20:15,120
他们肯定和好了
Aww, they must've made up.

408
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:15,880
他们抱在一起了
They're hugging.

409
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:21,920
这不太妙
This is not good.

410
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:24,060
还有更不妙的事
And more not good,

411
00:20:24,300 --> 00:20:26,520
为了偿还裙子的钱 我们得留在餐厅继续打工
we still have to work at the diner to pay off my dress.

412
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:29,200
鲍比的妈妈也诅咒我们了吗
Did Bobby's mother put a curse on us too?

413
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:36,820
我觉得他俩肉搏有点性感 是不是有点怪
Is it weird I think that's a little hot?

414
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:39,720
再让我看一眼戒指
Let me see the ring again.
